Release: current-member certificate unit validation fix
Timestamp: 2026-10-06T19:15:00Z
Source: main

Root cause fixed:
- /current-member.html was classified as a CMS-managed legacy route.
- The middleware replaced the repository form with an old Supabase CMS snapshot.
- That snapshot still submitted to /api/management and ignored the newer resilient submission client.
- Repository changes to current-member.html therefore did not reach the browser.

Permanent fix:
- Removed /current-member.html from CMS_LEGACY_ROUTES so the repository version is served directly.
- Made current-member.html self-contained by embedding membership-direct-submit.js.
- The submission client uses /membership-submit first, /api/management second, and the restricted public Supabase insert fallback third.
- The managed CMS snapshot was also updated immediately with the same self-contained page as an immediate live fix.

